# ===========================================================================
# Unreal Engine plugin repository -- repository root == plugin root
# (RoadBuilder.uplugin lives here)
#
# Only Config/ , Content/ and Source/ are source-controlled.
# Everything below is machine-generated and must never be committed.
#
# WARNING: do NOT stage with `git add .` / `git add -A` in this repository.
#          Stage explicitly, e.g. `git add Source/` or `git add .gitignore`.
# ===========================================================================

# --- Unreal Engine build artifacts (regenerated on every build) -------------
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/

# --- IDE / tooling project files -------------------------------------------
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sln
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.user
*.userprefs
*.vsconfig

# --- OS junk ---------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Local logs / scratch --------------------------------------------------
*.log

# --- AI assistant working memory (stays on disk, not part of the plugin) ----
.workbuddy/

# NOTE: `Build/` is intentionally NOT ignored -- plugins may ship icons or
# platform build scripts there. Same for `Resources/`.
